{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leading a squadron</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mach Speed Intercept is a quick turn-based game about predicting your opponent's paths. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Simply drag the arrow</i></strong> to plan your moves</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a squadron of pilots, watch your tail, and outsmart your opponent</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438610/extras/a24f09e8ccd9784566e2657cfaa4574d.poster.avif?t=1755788567\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438610/extras/a24f09e8ccd9784566e2657cfaa4574d.webm?t=1755788567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438610/extras/a24f09e8ccd9784566e2657cfaa4574d.mp4?t=1755788567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your squadron in campaign mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which pilots will intercept enemy bombers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your own airstrikes on the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your pilots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair your squadron's planes to stay mission ready</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438610/extras/219beb54a2c9483274772c70900b47ff.poster.avif?t=1755788567\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438610/extras/219beb54a2c9483274772c70900b47ff.webm?t=1755788567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so